================================================================================
ADDITIONAL NOTES FOR THIS PROJECT
================================================================================

This project is a Twitter / X media download SDK. The LICENSE above applies
to the SDK source code, documentation, examples, and configuration files.

It does NOT cover:
  - Downloaded media content (images, videos, GIFs) from Twitter / X. All
    media content is the intellectual property of the original authors and
    X Corp. Please respect the rights of content creators and comply with
    the X Terms of Service and applicable local laws.
  - User-provided configuration (e.g. config.toml containing personal
    cookies, user lists) and any data the user downloads with this SDK.
